ts only customer lookup. Use full resource fixtures for other\noperations; SDK types do not validate them at runtime.",[964,965,967],"h2",{"id":966},"test-your-storage-boundary","Test your storage boundary",[471,969,970,971,975,976,708],{},"Check the ",[972,973,974],"a",{"href":295},"storage contracts",": uniqueness under concurrency,\ntest\u002Flive separation, omitted versus null updates, and a declined ",[475,977,978],{},"store",[471,980,981,982,985],{},"For ",[972,983,984],{"href":313},"webhooks",", test valid, invalid, stale, and rotated signatures\nusing an independent HMAC signer. Concurrent copies must commit once. A failed\nreaction must roll back rows, audit markers, and outbox work, then succeed on retry.\nAlso test unknown events and out-of-order snapshots. Keep timestamp checks enabled.",[964,987,989],{"id":988},"live-test-mode-workflow","Live test-mode workflow",[991,992,993,1005,1011,1026],"ol",{},[994,995,996,997,1000,1001,1004],"li",{},"Set ",[475,998,999],{},"VATLY_API_KEY"," to a real ",[475,1002,1003],{},"test_"," key. Use customer and catalogue IDs from\nits storefront and mode. Test keys do not create real charges.",[994,1006,1007,1008,708],{},"Expose your local webhook route through an HTTPS tunnel. Register the public\nURL and save its signing secret as ",[475,1009,1010],{},"VATLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET",[994,1012,1013,1014,1017,1018,1021,1022,1025],{},"Pay through a ",[972,1015,1016],{"href":301},"hosted checkout",". Save the checkout\u002Forder IDs and\nconfirm signed ",[475,1019,1020],{},"checkout.paid"," and ",[475,1023,1024],{},"order.paid"," deliveries.",[994,1027,1028],{},"Check duplicate and failed deliveries. Delete or disable temporary endpoints\nbefore closing the tunnel; record any resources you create.",[471,1030,1031,1034,1035,1038,1039,634,1042,1038,1045,1038,1048,1051,1052,1055,1056,1059],{},[475,1032,1033],{},"vatly.testHelpers()"," exposes ",[475,1036,1037],{},"advanceRenewal",", ",[475,1040,1041],{},"forceRenewalPaid",[475,1043,1044],{},"forceRenewalFailed",[475,1046,1047],{},"forceOrderPaymentPaid",[475,1049,1050],{},"forceOrderPaymentFailed",", and the\nSDK-style ",[475,1053,1054],{},"fastForwardRenewal","\u002F",[475,1057,1058],{},"simulateOrderPayment",". These mutate account data.\nUse them only with permission and disposable test resources, not existing\nsubscriptions or orders just because the key is in test mode.",[964,1061,1063],{"id":1062},"test-your-edge-runtime","Test your edge runtime",[471,1065,1066],{},"For edge hosts, also run your app in the local edge runtime with its storage adapter.\nNode tests alone do not check edge compatibility.",[471,1068,1069,1070,1076,1077,708],{},"See the ",[972,1071,1075],{"href":1072,"rel":1073},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fguides\u002Ftesting",[1074],"nofollow","testing guide"," and\n",[972,1078,1081],{"href":1079,"rel":1080},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference\u002Ftest-helpers",[1074],"Test Helpers API reference",[1083,1084,1085],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .swJcz, html code.shiki .swJcz{--shiki-light:#E53935;--shiki-default:#F07178;--shiki-dark:#F07178}html pre.shiki code .sbssI, html code.shiki .sbssI{--shiki-light:#F76D4